  'nc-electrical-installation-level-4', 'Electrical Installation — Level 4', 'electrical-hvac', 4, 'Advanced', 'This programme will put into perspective all the requirements enabling the professional electrician to discharge his/her duties in accordance with the regulations of the Lighting Act and to successfully demonstrate the competencies required to acquire an electrical licence when exposed to this procedure set out by the Board of Electrical Examiners', 'Prior industry experience and completion of the relevant lower-level competencies are recommended; no formal platform prerequisite is enforced.', 'UNVERIFIED', 'CHCN L4', 26, 2115, 'published', 1)
