  'nc-carpentry-level-3', 'Carpentry — Level 3', 'construction-trades', 3, 'Advanced', 'This course is designed to develop advanced carpentry knowledge and practical skills required for employment and supervisory responsibilities in the construction industry. Learners build on Level 2 competencies by applying industry standards, interpreting complex construction drawings, and executing advanced carpentry tasks with accuracy and efficiency.', 'Prior experience in the field or completion of the Level 2 competencies is recommended; no formal platform prerequisite is enforced.', 'UNVERIFIED', 'CHCN L3', 64, 4985, 'published', 1)
