  'nc-housekeeping-operations-level-2', 'Housekeeping Operations — Level 2', 'hospitality', 2, 'Intermediate', 'This programme provides learners with the foundational skills and knowledge required to perform housekeeping duties in hospitality and institutional settings. It focuses on cleaning procedures, sanitation standards, room preparation, inventory management, and the use of cleaning equipment and chemicals.', 'No formal prerequisite; a basic command of English and numeracy is recommended.', 'UNVERIFIED', 'CHCN L2', 41, 2370, 'published', 1)
