  'nc-commercial-food-preparation-level-2', 'Commercial Food Preparation — Level 2', 'hospitality', 2, 'Intermediate', 'Trainees will be expected to prepare food according to recipes. They will be able to operate kitchen equipment, prepare platters and showpieces, and bake desserts and pastries. They will also be required to estimate food requirements, administer menu planning, maintain an inventory of kitchen supplies, and prepare and follow budgets.', 'No formal prerequisite; a basic command of English and numeracy is recommended.', 'UNVERIFIED', 'CHCN L2', 48, 3045, 'published', 1)
