  'nc-housekeeping-linen-room-attendant-level-2', 'Housekeeping (Linen Room Attendant) — Level 2', 'hospitality', 2, 'Intermediate', 'This course is designed to equip learners with the knowledge, skills and attitudes required to perform the duties of a Room Attendant in the housekeeping department of hotels, guesthouses, resorts and other accommodation facilities. Trainees gain hands-on training in cleaning, sanitizing and maintaining guest rooms and public areas to industry standards. The course emphasizes attention to detail, guest satisfaction, time management, safety procedures, and the use of modern cleaning equipment and chemicals.', 'No formal prerequisite; a basic command of English and numeracy is recommended.', 'UNVERIFIED', 'CHCN L2', 28, 659, 'published', 1)
