  'nc-industrial-security-operations-level-3', 'Industrial Security Operations — Level 3', 'security', 3, 'Advanced', 'This Level 3 programme prepares trainees to work effectively in the industrial security industry and to supervise security operations. It covers access and crowd control, legal and procedural requirements, occupational health and safety, conflict management, the use of batons and handcuffs, searches, surveillance and control-room monitoring, incident and emergency response, report writing, first aid, and the planning, coordination and supervision of security teams and operations.', 'Prior experience in the field or completion of the Level 2 competencies is recommended; no formal platform prerequisite is enforced.', 'UNVERIFIED', 'CHCN L3', 64, 1148, 'published', 1)
