  'nc-air-conditioning-and-refrigeration-level-2', 'Air Conditioning & Refrigeration (Domestic/Light-Commercial) — Level 2', 'electrical-hvac', 2, 'Intermediate', 'Air Conditioning and Refrigeration Level 2 is an intermediate, hands-on technical program that prepares learners to install, maintain, troubleshoot, and repair domestic and light-commercial cooling systems. It builds on fundamentals and introduces real-world skills used in the HVAC/R industry. Learners develop strong competencies in refrigeration cycle operation, electrical controls, system components, safe work practices, and servicing procedures.', 'No formal prerequisite; a basic command of English and numeracy is recommended.', 'UNVERIFIED', 'CHCN L2', 37, 2595, 'published', 1)
