  'nc-electrical-electronic-maintenance-level-2', 'Electrical / Electronic Maintenance — Level 2', 'electrical-hvac', 2, 'Intermediate', 'Electrical/Electronic Maintenance Level 2 is an intermediate technical program focused on developing the knowledge and practical skills needed to install, maintain, repair, and troubleshoot electrical and basic electronic systems. It builds on fundamentals and prepares learners for real-world roles in industrial, commercial, and residential maintenance environments. Learners gain hands-on experience working with electrical circuits, motors, control systems, wiring installations, and basic electronic devices', 'No formal prerequisite; a basic command of English and numeracy is recommended.', 'UNVERIFIED', 'CHCN L2', 38, 890, 'published', 1)
