  'nc-industrial-electrical-maintenance-level-3', 'Industrial Electrical Maintenance — Level 3', 'electrical-hvac', 3, 'Advanced', 'Industrial Electrical Maintenance Programme provides hands-on training in the installation, troubleshooting, and repair of electrical systems in industrial settings. Participants will gain expertise in electrical safety, motor controls, programmable logic controllers (PLCs), power distribution, and preventive maintenance. The programme is designed to equip trainees with the technical skills required to maintain and service electrical equipment in manufacturing plants, commercial facilities, and other industrial environments, ensuring compliance with safety and industry standards.', 'Prior experience in the field or completion of the Level 2 competencies is recommended; no formal platform prerequisite is enforced.', 'UNVERIFIED', 'CHCN L3', 41, 910, 'published', 1)
